  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oil in a deep frying pan to 350°F (180°C).",
    "In a large bowl, whisk together flour, eggs, melted butter, salt, baking powder, and black pepper.",
    "Add the corn and mix well.",
    "Drop the mixture by tablespoonfuls into the hot oil.",
    "Fry for 2-3 minutes or until golden brown.",
    "Drain on paper towels.",
    "Serve warm with a dollop of comfort (mayo or sour cream)."
